steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892500/extras/dc90e08cb1cc523909e783ca0a107543.webm?t=1725054715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892500/extras/dc90e08cb1cc523909e783ca0a107543.mp4?t=1725054715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated dungeon which makes every playthrough different<br></li><li>Survive. You need to take care of hunger, fatigue, and diseases<br></li><li>Fight monsters, or avoid them using tricks<br></li><li>Follow the story accompanied by beautiful illustrations while getting deeper into the dungeon to reveal its mystery<br></li><li>Skill tree that allows focussing on different play styles (fighting, stealth, room revealing)<br></li><li>Create new connections between rooms using a pickaxe, or by placing a ladder to climb upwards<br></li><li>Trading. Each trader in the game has a unique list of items and prices<br></li><li>Own a pet companion<br></li><li>Daily challenge. Compete with other players for the best score</li></ul>",
